WEBVTT

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:11.860
<i>The apple floated in the sky.</i>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:20.440
<i>The apple fell down to the ground.</i>

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:25.080
<i>The stars were born.</i>

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.720
<i>The songs were born.</i>

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:38.810
<i>The Lulu Amel smiled for eternity.</i>

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:43.290
<i>The stars kissed.</i>

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:48.250
<i>The songs slept.</i>

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:57.320
<i>Where will they call home?</i>

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:07.070
<i>Where will they call home?</i>

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>The apple fell down to the ground.</i>

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:25.520
<i>The apple floated in the sky.</i>

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.900
<i>Lost in a world gone astray...</i>

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.990
<i>Questions, nothing left to say.</i>

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:49.040
<i>But still, tomorrow remains, yeaaah!</i>

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.390
<i>Falling to pieces, a shattered dreamland,</i>

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.010
<i>nothing but shadows now.</i>

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.860
<i>(As night starts to fall.)</i>

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.430
<i>Open your eyes to a brand new nightmare.</i>

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.230
<i>Try to escape, but how?</i>

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.600
Are you okay?

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:11.030
<i>(As light wakes us all.)</i>

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.730
<i>What does the future hold?</i>

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.040
<i>(A fallen world once bold?)</i>

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.040
I'm fine.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:16.610
<i>Can we escape this cold? 
(Fate abandoned.)</i>

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:16.610
Dr. Ver, you need to get to the front of the train.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.250
<i>When will a new sun rise? 
(When will we realize?)</i>

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:17.830
Right.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.610
Trouble! A ton of Noise is following us!

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:22.730
<i>How many dreams must die? 
(We can't turn back now.)</i>

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:24.370
They're clearly focused on us...

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:25.710
<i>Entwined in darkness, the light starts to fall.</i>

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.790
It's like someone's controlling them.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.750
<i>Merciful gods will mean nothing at all.</i>

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.750
Let's hurry!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.250
<i>Stand on hallowed ground, reflect inside.</i>

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.840
<i>So many questions remain.</i>

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:38.420
<i>Tainted sanity preys upon us.</i>

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.490
They've passed checkpoint 71.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.020
<i>We have to escape this pain.</i>

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:43.140
They're almost to the Iwakuni 
US military base, but...

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.140
<i>(I will fly!)</i>

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.470
<i>Stand up, stand up. Come on, let's go now.</i>

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.890
The enemy must have targeted when the 
train was as far from us as possible.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.560
<i>We will never fall again.</i>

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:47.480
<i>(Not again!)</i>

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.390
Commander, this must be...

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:57.050
<i>Fate will never begin to bind us in dark oblivion.</i>

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:50.630
Yes.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:54.900
We can assume someone is 
after the Staff of Solomon.

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:01.410
<i>Stand on hallowed ground, reflect inside.</i>

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.820
<i>So many questions remain.</i>

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.160
Yes. Yes.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:07.320
<i>Tainted sanity preys upon us.</i>

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:08.650
A signal pattern coming in at high speed, 
among that of multiple Noise?

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.920
<i>We have to escape this pain.</i>

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.170
Three months ago,

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.000
<i>(I will fly!)</i>

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:13.370
<i>Stand up, stand up. Come on, let's go now.</i>

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.420
after the Lunar Attack that shocked the world,

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.690
<i>We will never fall again.</i>

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.800
the Japanese government publicly 
released the Sakurai Theory data.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.880
<i>(Not again!)</i>

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:25.800
<i>Fate will never begin to bind us in dark oblivion.</i>

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:21.960
Most of it is still shrouded in mystery.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.980
But if we can analyze the Ark Scepter,
the Staff of Solomon, that we recovered

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:33.620
we may find a new way to fight the designated 
abnormal disaster, Noise, plaguing our world...

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.610
That thing...

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.130
The Staff of Solomon...

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.820
It isn't something you should mess with.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.580
Chris-chan?

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.030
Not that I have the right to talk.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.180
D-Dummy, not now!

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.040
It's okay.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.170
You really are a dummy.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:59.000
Understood. We'll engage.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.420
It's our turn, isn't it?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.110
Let's go!

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:16.330
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.180
Look at all the little birdies!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.080
No matter how many of them come,

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.070
with the combination we've been practicing...

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.080
That thing isn't done yet.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:55.850
Don't get any weird ideas about 
trying it in a real fight.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.610
Yeah, we should save it for 
when we really need it.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.610
If you know that, don't make me say it.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.970
You're watching my back, okay?

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:06.990
Leave it to me!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:12.160
<i>Clenched fists, 1,000% thunder.</i>

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:16.710
<i>Unleash everything you have. 
Three, two, one, zero!</i>

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:22.210
<i>Take the shortest way, an unwavering line.</i>

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:26.340
<i>To share with you... Burst it...</i>

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.600
<i>To reach you!</i>

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:34.430
<i>"Why does it have to be me?"</i>

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:39.050
<i>It's an untrodden path, there is no answer!</i>

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.690
<i>You're the only one I want to protect...</i>

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:46.500
<i>So jump high!</i>

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.450
<i>Resound, resound, my heart!</i>

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.870
<i>Sing passionately, my heart!</i>

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.580
<i>It's all right, everything is just fine.</i>

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.850
<i>Because I made sure I was ready for this!</i>

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.340
<i>Even if my life withers away,</i>

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.050
<i>the warmth when we hold hands</i>

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.700
<i>leaves something, shares something.</i>

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.470
So that's the one running things?

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.220
<i>Looking up at the future,</i>

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:15.430
<i>stand strong, and believe 
you'll be born as a flower!</i>

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:22.970
All right, then...

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:38.960
Chris-chan!

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:51.340
<i>Noise are supposed to be simple creatures,</i>

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.970
<i>focused only on killing.</i>

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:56.470
<i>But the way they're moving...</i>

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.600
<i>They're being controlled, 
in order to pursue a target.</i>

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:03.160
<i>Can something other than the 
Staff of Solomon do that?</i>

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.870
If only we still had the X-Drive 
Mode that enabled us to fly,

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:17.290
we wouldn't have to deal with them individually!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.620
Ch-Chris-chan!

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.800
Just made it...

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:29.170
Thanks, you saved me...

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:32.530
Damn it! Now what the hell do we do?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:33.430
I know!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:34.930
Did you get a good idea?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.900
I once saw it in my master's combat manuals!

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:41.440
It said we only need to break the 
coupler between train cars!

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:45.590
His "combat manuals" are mostly action movies, right?

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.650
Are those really gonna help?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:50.490
Anyway, if you hit the Noise with a train car,

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.750
they'll go straight through, right?

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.450
That isn't all I'll hit them with!

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:02.210
Hurry! Before we leave the tunnel!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:06.340
Thanks, Chris-chan!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.210
Is this really going to work?

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.490
I just do this...

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.790
<i>You're the only one I want to protect...</i>

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:26.770
<i>So jump high!</i>

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.450
<i>Resound, resound, my heart!</i>

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.200
<i>Sing passionately, my heart!</i>

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.410
<i>It's all right, everything is just fine.</i>

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.830
<i>Because I made sure I was ready for this!</i>

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.280
<i>Even if my life withers away,</i>

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.050
<i>the warmth when we hold hands</i>

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.580
<i>leaves something, saves something.</i>

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.920
<i>Looking up at the future,</i>

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:55.230
<i>stand strong, and believe 
you'll be born as a flower!</i>

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:58.950
<i>She used the enclosed space 
to keep them in one spot,</i>

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.680
<i>and hit them with a heavy strike 
from beyond an obstacle.</i>

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.040
<i>How good has she gotten?</i>

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.090
This concludes your transport mission.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:16.760
Good work.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:17.950
Thank you.

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.450
I've seen first-hand

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:26.210
the reason you're called
 the heroes of the Lunar Attack.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.930
Heroes?! Us?!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.370
Wow! No one ever compliments me,

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.350
so tell me more...

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.110
Actually, tell me a lot more—

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:38.640
You dummy.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.630
That's the reason no one ever does.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.990
That hurt, Chris-chan...

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:45.910
We desire heroes because

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:48.270
the world's in such a state.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.520
Yes, a great hero

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:54.530
whom everyone believes in!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.280
Aw, you're flattering me!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:02.280
I'll make sure what you protected 
is put to good use.

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:04.970
The Staff of Solomon can be a handful,

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.920
so please take good care of it!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.410
We're counting on you.

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:16.470
The mission's all done.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.220
And now...

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.010
Yeah!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.930
If we hurry, we can make it 
to Tsubasa-san's concert!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.360
You guys did great,

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:26.850
so the commander says he'll 
send a helicopter to Tokyo.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.560
Seriously?

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:32.880
Seriously?

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.260
Yeah, seriously!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.490
We're ready here.

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:18.690
As soon as Sacrist S arrives,

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.460
you should be able to begin.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:23.620
Then there's no time to waste, huh?

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.020
Okay, Mom.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.370
It's time for the curtain to rise 
on the last concert on Earth.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.610
Yes, things are already under control.

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:39.060
But Dr. Ver's name is among
 those of the missing.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.250
And...

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.260
The Staff of Solomon is gone, too.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.290
I see.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:45.810
Got it.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.760
Get back here ASAP.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:48.890
Understood.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:53.900
Was this attack set up by someone?

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:02.180
Can you feel the excitement?

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:04.800
A dream collaboration between two top artists,

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:07.450
broadcast in major cities all around the world.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.790
The audience's excitement 
has reached its peak,

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:13.940
as the diva Maria's special concert is about to begin!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.050
I understand the situation.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.710
I'll bring Tsubasa-san back.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:19.730
No need.

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:23.720
If the Noise is attacking, 
we can't give up today's concert.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.080
You're right.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:27.320
I'll let you handle it, then.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.620
What did the commander say?

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:33.640
He's expecting a lot from you today.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:39.660
If you've taken off your glasses,

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:42.610
that means you aren't in 
manager mode, Ogawa-san.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.090
If you can't remember your own habits,

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:46.200
the enemy will—

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.520
It's about time.

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.790
Please get ready!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.380
Right! I'm on my way!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.480
Healing the hearts of the wounded

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.870
is an important job, Kazanari Tsubasa.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.500
Do your best.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:03.010
I'm not happy about it, but all right.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:06.010
You can give me the details later.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.780
<b>If you want peace, prepare for war.</b>

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.700
They're finally here.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.660
I was getting tired of waiting.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.600
That's Maria Cadenzavna Eve for you!

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:48.090
She's so much more amazing in person!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:51.640
It's only been a few months since 
she appeared on the US charts,

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.060
but her stage presence is so great.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:56.100
I was hoping we could learn something 
for the next school fair,

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.540
but there's no way we could imitate that!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.320
That was never happening, Itaba-san.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.310
No word from Bikky yet?

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:07.560
The main event's starting soon.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:09.130
Yeah.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:13.020
Kazanari-san gave her that invitation, too...

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.960
She's missing a special, one-night-only performance.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.770
She never betrays your expectations!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.000
Let me see you

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:35.640
unsheathed on the battlefield.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:44.020
<i>Tonight the world will truly become one.</i>

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.880
<i>Hear my voice, grant my wish,</i>

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:51.940
<i>and let's begin!</i>

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.290
<i>Three, two, one. Ready go... Fly!</i>

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.790
<i>This endless, strong emotion,</i>

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.920
<i>this strong emotion I'll never give up.</i>

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:07.500
<i>An immortal melody that can't be defeated!</i>

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:16.060
<i>Shine, true heart!</i>

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:23.560
<i>The heartbeat, which gives life, 
slipped and fell from my hand.</i>

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:29.610
<i>What does the shattered moonlight 
ask those left behind?</i>

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:35.990
<i>Unite your sadness to form a sword, a blade...</i>

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.870
<i>In the name of justice.</i>

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:48.260
<i>Light an ember of the soul that 
will never disappear again!</i>

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:49.830
<i>Ignition.</i>

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.640
<i>Burn... There is no such thing as destiny.</i>

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.890
<i>Fly! And rip apart your cage!</i>

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:57.600
<i>Go!</i>

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:01.050
<i>Flapping our wings passionately, 
and resounding to share.</i>

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:03.270
<i>Playing our music to share the bonds between us!</i>

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.020
<i>That's right, hold our tears in close.</i>

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:09.310
<i>Holding close all the burdens we bore.</i>

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:12.320
<i>We'll turn our immortal dreams into wings!</i>

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:18.450
<i>So will you fly to tomorrow with me?</i>

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:25.520
<i>Sing, Phoenix Song!</i>

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.680
Wow!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.220
Senpai!

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.230
Thank you, everyone.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:52.070
You always

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.320
give me so much courage.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:56.120
So today,

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:59.070
I want to give some of that courage back

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.500
to everyone who listens to my songs.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:10.100
I shall give all my songs to the whole world!

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.260
I won't look back. I'll go forward as fast as I can.

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:16.010
Come with me, but only if you can keep up!

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:24.800
I am grateful that I was able to 
participate in this concert.

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:28.840
And for the fact that I was able to sing

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:32.050
with Japan's top artist, Kazanari Tsubasa.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:36.780
And I'm honored to meet such a splendid artist...

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.630
We have to tell the world

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.040
that songs have power.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:47.190
The power to change the world.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:53.550
And one more thing...

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:11.940
Stay calm...

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.150
Stay calm!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:22.080
Multiple Noise detected at the 
concert hall for the Queens of Music!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.160
What?

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.300
They're late.

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:30.550
However, now we can finally begin the plan.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.790
Th-This isn't an anime...

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.610
Why is this happening?

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:40.850
Hibiki...

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.540
Roger.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.660
The two wielders will reach the 
mission zone in forty minutes.

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:51.610
We'll get it under control.

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.230
You heard him.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.500
This'll make three fights in a row without rest, 
but we're counting on you.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.860
More Noise under someone's control...

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:03.120
We still don't know the details, but...

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.730
But...

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.980
It's hard to believe the Noise that 
were after the Staff of Solomon

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:13.000
and those that appeared at 
the concert are unrelated.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.260
You're a scary girl.

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:28.270
Even in this situation, you're looking 
for a chance to jump me.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.260
But don't be so hasty.

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:34.150
Do you think the audience can 
survive an attack from Noise?

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:36.550
And what's more...

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:42.310
The concert's being broadcast all over the world.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.450
The Japanese government made 
the existence of the Symphogears public,

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.810
but they never gave their wielders' identities.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:53.690
Am I wrong, Kazanari Tsubasa-san?

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:55.490
Don't insult me.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.280
Did you think

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.550
if you said that, it would stop me
 from drawing my sword?

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:05.020
I like that about you.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:09.060
If only everyone could fight to 
protect someone, like you...

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:13.060
The world might have been a better place.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.150
What did you say?

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.650
Maria Cadenzavna Eve...

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.610
Just who are you?

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:24.180
Yes... I suppose it's time.

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:34.830
We have the power to control the Noise.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:38.140
And we have demands for every 
country on the planet!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:41.530
She's making an enemy out of the entire world?

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:42.840
It's like...

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:47.610
A declaration of war.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:49.660
And...

00:20:53.900 --> 00:21:02.110
<i>Granzizel bilfen Gungnir zizzl.</i>

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.480
Impossible!

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.460
This waveform pattern...

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:12.870
It can't be...

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.300
Gungnir?

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:45.080
A black Gungnir...

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.290
I am...

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.710
We are Finé.

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:56.540
Yes...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.210
Those who bear the name of the end!

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>The Gungnir Girl</b>
